  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Aura</strong> faint Dark; <strong>CL</strong> 3rd<br>\n<strong>Slot</strong> none; <strong>Price</strong> 450 gp; <strong>Weight</strong> 0.1 lbs.</p>\n<p><strong>Description</strong><br>\nAs a standard action, you may make a ranged touch attack against a square within 30 feet. All creatures within 10 feet of the hit square becomes immune to all negative effects of any areas of darkness you create for 30 minutes. This does not grant affected creatures the ability to see in your darkness if they do not already possess a way to do so, but it does allow creatures with darkvision to see in pure darkness. Alternatively, you may choose to pour the powder over a single creature; if you do the effect will instead linger for 3 hours.</p>\n<p><strong>Construction Requirements</strong><br>\nDistill Compound, Dark sphere (Clearsight (meld)); <strong>Cost</strong> 225 gp</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/compounds#toc23\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
